    "stratum": "Only later p16 Advanced Setup chosen-alien reveal instruction, explicitly attributed; no source-policy reconsideration",
    "source_fragments": [
      {
        "source": "original",
        "start_char": 12039,
        "end_char": 12302,
        "text": "The player takes the alien sheets corresponding to\nthe two flares and looks at them in secret, choosing one of\nthe two aliens to play during this game. The chosen alien is\nplaced facedown in front of the player, while the other alien\nsheet is returned to the box.",
        "sha256": "5aaf0680070e111b3ec66bc2c04960f92e1a3b8971935d4c6c944afcda76956e"
      },
      {
        "source": "later",
        "start_char": 56866,
        "end_char": 57142,
        "text": "4. Choose Aliens: Shuffle the flare cards and deal two \nfacedown to each player. Each player takes the two alien \nsheets matching their flare cards, chooses one sheet to \nkeep, and returns the other to the game box. Then, all \nplayers reveal their chosen sheet simultaneously.",
        "sha256": "7ef96ad5cd73ce77e6a9f587d2b52c45ee70e9ad78764beafa87e68477e25975"
      },
      {
        "source": "later",
        "start_char": 57143,
        "end_char": 57436,
        "text": "5. Prepare Cosmic Deck: Collect the flare cards that \nwere dealt to each player; if playing with fewer than \nfive players, add additional flares randomly to bring \nthe total to 10. Then, shuffle those 10 flares with the \nencounter, reinforcement, and artifact cards to create the \ncosmic deck.",
        "sha256": "ad33052058b0df3c93e725e50dc7f2db8ee2ea7eb4251cba4fafbf5db9bf43e1"
      }
    ],
    "eligible_source_field_inventory": [
